    "chunk_text": "ceow & lege on. Eft, wulfes heafod ban b\u00e6rn swi\u00f0e & gecnua smale, asyft \u00feurh cla\u00f0, do on \u00fe\u00e6t dolg. Wi\u00f0 li\u00fe w\u00e6rce cnua wermod wi\u00fe teorwe & fencersan, awring \u00fe\u00e6t seaw of, meng tosomne, cl\u00e6m on Wi\u00fe li\u00f0 seawe, gelodwyrt, brune wyrt & hare wyrt lytelu, oftost weaxe\u00fe on tune, h\u00e6f\u00f0 hwite \u00de\u00e6t bi\u00fe god sealf. Manegum men li\u00f0 seau syh\u00f0, gewring \u00e6ples seaw on & hornes sceafo\u00fean swi\u00f0e smale gesceaf, Wi\u00fe li\u00f0 seawe, li\u00fewyrt, hundes heafod, geb\u00e6rne & gecnuwige & gebr\u00e6dedne \u00e6ppel, meng \u00fe\u00e6t eall Eft, genim surne \u00e6ppel, gebr\u00e6d & lege on, do grut on ufan \u00feone \u00e6ppel. Wi\u00fe li\u00f0 seawe genim mage\u00fean, meng wi\u00f0 hunig, do on \u00fe\u00e6t dolg & bind f\u00e6ste. Wi\u00fe seawe genim acrinde & drige & wirc to smedman & slah\u00feorn rinde nio\u00feowearde, syft \u00fea \u00feurh Wi\u00f0 li\u00f0 seawe genim cetelhrum & berenhealm, geb\u00e6rn & gnid tog\u00e6dere & scad on. Gif li\u00feule utyrne genim merce nio\u00feoweardne & hunig & hw\u00e6tenes meluwes smedman & wicggan Eft, genim medowyrte nio\u00feowearde, gecnua smale, meng wi\u00fe hunige, lege on \u00fe\u00e6t gebatod sie. Gif li\u00feule utyrne genim eced & sure cruman berenes hlafes & renwyrmas, meng tosomne,",
